{{PageBanner|Pokopangbanner.png}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the LINE Sticker brand known as '''Pokopang!''' (ポコパン Pokopan) was held from April 25th, 2018 to May 9th, 2018. The collaboration includes exclusive stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration period.<br>
The game is published by Treenod Inc.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''LINE Pokopang'''}} and The Battle Cats join together for a Special Collab event!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''May 17th (11am) through May 31st, 2018 (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Collab Stages in The Battle Cats'''}}<br>
The Cat Army invades the Poko Forest?!<br>
Take on the fiesty forest friends of Line Pokopang as special enemies in these limited edition collab stages!

Log into The Battle Cats and head to Stories of Legend to challenge the special stage {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Poko Forest Friends'''}}!<br>
Earn higher scores on these stages to pick up bigger and better rewards!<br>
<small><small>※ Tap the Timed Score button to check out the prizes you can win at each collab stage!</small></small>

Achieve the highest score on each stage to unlock another limited edition Collab Unit. Can you collect the whole gang of [[Pokota (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Pokota'''}}]], [[Ovis (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Ovis'''}}]], and [[Coco (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Coco'''}}]]?<br>
After being unlocked, the Pokopang characters can be activated at the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.
You can also take on the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Expert Stage "Trio from the Woods"'''}} and collect huge XP rewards!<br>
<small><small>※Make sure that you are updated to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access Line Pokopang collab content.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Cat Food Every Day During the Collab!'''}}<br>
Log into the Battle Cats and visit the Cat Base menu each day to receive a gift of {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food'''}}!

